the knowledge base n0008_lx_arithmetic includes:

the text of the_model is at "sources/0008-LX-arithmetic.dmn".

rule payment_1 with provenance the model at decision payment:
the payment is a number N if
    a number M = 1 + the rate of the loan / 12
    and an exponent E = 0 - the term months of the loan
    and the power of M to E is a result R
    and N = the principal of the loan * the rate of the loan / 12 / (1 - R).

